{"id":44443,"date":"2025-09-10T21:53:43","date_gmt":"2025-09-10T20:53:43","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=44443"},"modified":"2026-11-08T13:46:14","modified_gmt":"2026-11-08T12:46:14","slug":"santa-maria-trail-smat","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/santa-maria-trail-smat\/","title":{"rendered":"Santa Maria Trail \u2013 SMAT 2027"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Santa Maria Trail \u2013 SMAT 2027<\/span><\/h2><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O <strong>Santa Maria Trail \u2013 SMAT 2027<\/strong> realiza-se no domingo, <strong>31 de janeiro de 2027<\/strong>, no concelho de <strong>Vila do Porto<\/strong>, na paradis\u00edaca <strong>Ilha de Santa Maria<\/strong>, a mais meridional e soalheira do arquip\u00e9lago dos <strong>A\u00e7ores<\/strong>. Certificado pela <strong>ATRP<\/strong> e limitado a 500 vagas no conjunto dos seus escal\u00f5es, o evento constitui uma refer\u00eancia maior do trail running insular em Portugal.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Com secretariado na Igreja de Nossa Senhora da Vit\u00f3ria e transferes assegurados a partir da <strong>Pra\u00e7a do Munic\u00edpio de Vila do Porto<\/strong>, o programa desportivo contempla o <strong>Trail Longo SMAT35 (35 km \/ 1.820 m D+)<\/strong> \u00e0s <strong>08:00<\/strong>, o <strong>Trail Curto SMAT20 (20 km \/ 900 m D+)<\/strong> \u00e0s <strong>09:00<\/strong>, o <strong>Mini Trail SMAT10 (10 km \/ 240 m D+)<\/strong> \u00e0s <strong>10:00<\/strong>, a <strong>Caminhada SMAT (10 km)<\/strong> \u00e0s <strong>10:10<\/strong> e o <strong>Trail Kids (5 km \/ 100 m D+)<\/strong> \u00e0s <strong>11:00<\/strong>. Os trilhos percorrem arribas vulc\u00e2nicas f\u00f3sseis, linhas de \u00e1gua e caminhos florestais \u00fanicos da ilha.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">A organiza\u00e7\u00e3o est\u00e1 a cargo da Sec\u00e7\u00e3o de Trail Running da <strong>Casa do Povo de S\u00e3o Pedro<\/strong>, com o apoio institucional da <strong>C\u00e2mara Municipal de Vila do Porto<\/strong>, assegurando t-shirt t\u00e9cnica (at\u00e9 ao fecho da 2\u00aa fase), abastecimentos, lembran\u00e7a finisher e almo\u00e7o conv\u00edvio p\u00f3s-prova. Consulta o calend\u00e1rio nacional de provas de <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/trail\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline;\">Trail Running em Portugal<\/a>.<\/p><\/div><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2><ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\"><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">31 de Janeiro de 2027<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Local, Concelho & Distrito<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Pra\u00e7a do Munic\u00edpio, Vila do Porto, Ilha de Santa Maria, A\u00e7ores<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Dist\u00e2ncias<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">3