12.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"><\/span><\/div><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Fase 3 (17\/11\/2026 a 15\/01\/2027):<\/strong> 15.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"><\/span><\/div><\/div><\/div><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\"><div style=\"flex: 1; min-width: 200px;\"><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Trail Kids<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Trail Kids \u2013 5 km (8\u201315 anos)<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 31 de Janeiro de 2027 \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 11:00 \u2022 \u26f0\ufe0f 100m D+<\/span><\/div><div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\"><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Fase \u00danica (At\u00e9 15\/01\/2027):<\/strong> 5.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"><\/span><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/ul><\/div><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quando e onde se realiza o Santa Maria Trail \u2013 SMAT 2027?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O evento realiza-se no domingo, 31 de janeiro de 2027, no concelho de Vila do Porto, na Ilha de Santa Maria (A\u00e7ores), com secretariado na Igreja de Nossa Senhora da Vit\u00f3ria (sexta das 18:00 \u00e0s 21:00, s\u00e1bado das 16:00 \u00e0s 21:00 e domingo a partir das 06:30).<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias, desn\u00edveis e hor\u00e1rios de partida?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O programa integra o Trail Longo SMAT35 (35 km, 1.820 m D+, partida \u00e0s 08:00), Trail Curto SMAT20 (20 km, 900 m D+, \u00e0s 09:00), Mini Trail SMAT10 (10 km, 240 m D+, \u00e0s 10:00), Caminhada SMAT (10 km, \u00e0s 10:10) e Trail Kids (5 km, 100 m D+, \u00e0s 11:00).<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os valores e fases de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es decorrem at\u00e9 15 de janeiro de 2027 em 3 fases (at\u00e9 15\/09, at\u00e9 16\/11 e at\u00e9 15\/01): SMAT35 (35 \u20ac \/ 40 \u20ac \/ 45 \u20ac), SMAT20 (25 \u20ac \/ 30 \u20ac \/ 35 \u20ac), SMAT10 (15 \u20ac \/ 20 \u20ac \/ 25 \u20ac), Caminhada (10 \u20ac \/ 12 \u20ac \/ 15 \u20ac) e Trail Kids (5 \u20ac).<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 o tempo limite de cada prova e material obrigat\u00f3rio?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Os tempos limite s\u00e3o de 7h00 no Trail Longo (35 km), 5h00 no Trail Curto (20 km) e na Caminhada, e 4h00 no Mini Trail (10 km). \u00c9 obrigat\u00f3rio transportar dorsal vis\u00edvel, reserva de \u00e1gua m\u00ednima de 500 ml, mochila, telem\u00f3vel operacional, manta t\u00e9rmica, apito, corta-vento\/imperme\u00e1vel e copo pr\u00f3prio.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">O que inclui a inscri\u00e7\u00e3o no Santa Maria Trail \u2013 SMAT?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A inscri\u00e7\u00e3o inclui seguro desportivo, dorsal com chip, t-shirt t\u00e9cnica (garantida at\u00e9 ao final da 2\u00aa fase a 16 de novembro), abastecimentos s\u00f3lidos e l\u00edquidos, transferes a partir da Pra\u00e7a do Munic\u00edpio de Vila do Porto, lembran\u00e7a finisher e almo\u00e7o conv\u00edvio \u00e0s 12:00 (op\u00e7\u00e3o normal ou vegetariana).<\/div><\/details><\/div><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"Santa Maria Trail \u2013 SMAT 2027\", \"startDate\": \"2027-01-31\", \"endDate\": \"2027-01-31\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Pra\u00e7a do Munic\u00edpio, Vila do Porto, Ilha de Santa Maria, A\u00e7ores\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Vila do Porto\", \"addressRegion\": \"A\u00e7ores\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"description\": \"O Santa Maria Trail \u2013 SMAT 2027 realiza-se a 31 de janeiro na Ilha de Santa Maria, A\u00e7ores. Provas de 35 km, 20 km, 10 km, Caminhada e Kids. Inscreve-te j\u00e1!\", \"image\": [\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/santa-maria-trail-smat-2027.webp\"], \"offers\": [{\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"Trail Longo SMAT35 \u2013 35 km\", \"price\": \"40.00\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/stopandgo.net\/events\/santa-maria-trail-smat-2027\", \"validFrom\": \"2027-01-01\"}, {\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"Trail Curto SMAT20 \u2013 20 km\", \"price\": \"30.00\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/stopandgo.net\/events\/santa-maria-trail-smat-2027\", \"validFrom\": \"2027-01-01\"}, {\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"Mini Trail SMAT10 \u2013 10 km\", \"price\": \"20.00\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/stopandgo.net\/events\/santa-maria-trail-smat-2027\", \"validFrom\": \"2027-01-01\"}, {\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"Caminhada SMAT \