 \u20ac \/ 45 \u20ac), SMAT20 (25 \u20ac \/ 30 \u20ac \/ 35 \u20ac), SMAT10 (15 \u20ac \/ 20 \u20ac \/ 25 \u20ac), Caminhada (10 \u20ac \/ 12 \u20ac \/ 15 \u20ac) e Trail Kids (5 \u20ac).\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Qual \u00e9 o tempo limite de cada prova e material obrigat\u00f3rio?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Os tempos limite s\u00e3o de 7h00 no Trail Longo (35 km), 5h00 no Trail Curto (20 km) e na Caminhada, e 4h00 no Mini Trail (10 km). \u00c9 obrigat\u00f3rio transportar dorsal vis\u00edvel, reserva de \u00e1gua m\u00ednima de 500 ml, mochila, telem\u00f3vel operacional, manta t\u00e9rmica, apito, corta-vento\/imperme\u00e1vel e copo pr\u00f3prio.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"O que inclui a inscri\u00e7\u00e3o no Santa Maria Trail \u2013 SMAT?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A inscri\u00e7\u00e3o inclui seguro desportivo, dorsal com chip, t-shirt t\u00e9cnica (garantida at\u00e9 ao final da 2\u00aa fase a 16 de novembro), abastecimentos s\u00f3lidos e l\u00edquidos, transferes a partir da Pra\u00e7a do Munic\u00edpio de Vila do Porto, lembran\u00e7a finisher e almo\u00e7o conv\u00edvio \u00e0s 12:00 (op\u00e7\u00e3o normal ou vegetariana).\"}}]}<\/script>","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":66330,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[672,22,497,739,498],"event_type_2":[104,820],"event_type_3":[],"event_type_4":[],"event_type_5":[823],"class_list":["post-44443","ajde_events","type-ajde_events","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","event_location-acores","event_type-caminhada","event_type-trail","event_type-trail-curto","event_type-kids-trail","event_type-trail-longo","event_type_2-acores","event_type_2-portugal","event_type_5-circuito-atrp"],"acf":[],"featured_image_src":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/santa-maria-trail-smat-20